# The engine is threaded (pthreads -> SharedArrayBuffer), and browsers only
# grant SharedArrayBuffer to cross-origin-isolated pages. Both headers must
# arrive on every response, including the .wasm and the 57 MB data package —
# without them the symptom is a black canvas, not an error naming headers.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: cross-origin
